<report>
<line><title>Gini coefficient of inequality</title></line>
<block name="data">
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Analysis for <in>ti</in>:</subtitle></line>
<line></line>
<line>Positive non-zero observations = <in>n</in>  <warn><in>msg</in></warn></line>
<line>Variance coefficient = <in>cv</in></line>
<line></line>
<line>Re-samples = <in>boots</in></line>
<line>Bias = <in>bias</in></line>
<line>Standard error (bootstrap) = <in>se</in></line>
<line></line>
<line>Gini coefficient = <in>gini</in></line>
<line><ci>Percentile <in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci></line>
<line><ci>BCa <in>pc</in>% CI = <in>BCafrom</in> to <in>BCato</in></ci></line>
<line></line>
<line>Unbiased estimator of population Gini coefficient = <in>gini-unbiased</in></line>
<line><ci>Percentile <in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from-unbiased</in> to <in>to-unbiased</in></ci></line>
<line><ci>BCa <in>pc</in>% CI = <in>BCafrom-unbiased</in> to <in>BCato-unbiased</in></ci></line>
</block>
